msgstr "Odabrana kamera se ne može otvoriti"

#: src/onboarding.py:582
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Pokušajte odabrati drugu"

#: src/onboarding.py:597
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Molimo posjetite\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"da omogućite svoj IR emiter"

#: src/onboarding.py:665
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Postavljanje osvjetljenje 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:666
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Postavljanje osvjetljenje 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Nije moguće sačuvati model lica"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Skeniraj drugi model"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Nije moguće snimiti drugi model"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Vaš prvi model je sačuvan, tako da prijava lica već radi. Soba i dalje mora "
"biti dovoljno svijetla da se vidi vaše lice – promijenite svjetlo umjesto da "
"ga ugasite – zatim pokušajte ponovo ili preskočite i dodajte model kasnije "
"iz postavki."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Drugo skeniranje: naočale, brada ili drugačije osvjetljenje"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Prvi model je sačuvan: prijava licem već radi. Drugi model čini "
"prepoznavanje pouzdanijim kada se nešto promijeni: stavite naočale koje "
"ponekad nosite (ili ih skinite), snimite ga s drugačijom bradom i "
"promijenite svjetlo — upalite ili ugasite lampu, odmaknite se od prozora. "
"Držite lice jasno vidljivim i ponovo pritisnite Skeniraj; slijedi isto "
"kratko vođeno snimanje."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} koristeći autentifikaciju "
"licem (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> Provjera TPM hardvera i alata..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} koristeći autentifikaciju "
"licem (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> Otkriven je TPM hardver. Automatsko instaliranje <i>tpm2-"
"tools</i>..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} koristeći autentifikaciju "
"licem (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> Hardverski TPM 2.0 aktivan. Vaša lozinka će biti sigurno "
"zapečaćena unutar TPM-a."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} koristeći autentifikaciju "
"licem (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> TPM hardver je otkriven, ali automatska instalacija "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> nije uspjela. Pokrenite <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</"
"code>. Vraćanje na softversko keširanje vjerodajnica."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} koristeći autentifikaciju "
"licem (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> Nije otkriven TPM hardver. Korištenje softverskog "
"keširanja vjerodajnica (AES-256-GCM)."

